                </dataPath>
                <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>Expression in 1C:Enterprise language that determines the applicability of the rule when importing objects from 1C:Document Management</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>عبارتی به زبان 1C:Enterprise که کاربرد قاعده را هنگام ورود اشیا از 1C:Document Management تعیین می‌کند</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Выражение на встроенном языке, определяющее применимость правила при загрузке объектов из 1С:Документооборота</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Nesnelerin 1C:Document Management'tan içe aktarımı sırasında kuralın uygulanabilirliğini belirleyen yerleşik dil ifadesi</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>Expression in 1C:Enterprise language that determines the applicability of the rule when importing objects from 1C:Document Management</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>Expression in 1C:Enterprise language that determines the applicability of the rule when importing objects from 1C:Document Management</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Expression in 1C:Enterprise language that determines the applicability of the rule when importing objects from 1C:Document Management</value>
                </toolTip>
